/// Unicode 17.0.0's full lowercase mapping, packed.
///
/// **186 records, 2,418 bytes**, covering 1,488 code points. [`upperRuns`]'s
/// shape exactly, and smaller for the reason [`toLower`] gives: one code point
/// expands here where 102 do there.
///
/// `U+03A3` is **not** in this table, and its absence is deliberate — a table
/// row would answer `σ` unconditionally and [`toLower`] would never ask
/// [`sigmaIsFinal`]. The generator drops it and asserts that it did.
fn lowerRuns() -> String {
  "000210J10@010000600G10@0100006H0710@010000800H20@0010009@011100030009B0320@0010009I0820@001000::0G20@001000;H0110?OL7000;I0320@001000<10110@06B000<20220@001000<60110@06>000<70110@001000<90210@06=000<;0110@001000<>0110@02?000<?0110@06:000<@0110@06;000<A0110@001000<C0110@06=000<D0110@06?000<F0110@06C000<G0110@06A000<H0110@001000<L0110@06C000<M0110@06E000<O0110@06F000=00320@001000=60110@06J000=70110@001000=90110@06J000=<0110@001000=>0110@06J000=?0110@001000=A0210@06I000=C0220@001000=G0110@06K000=H0110@001000=L0110@001000>40110@002000>50110@001000>70110@002000>80110@001000>:0110@002000>;0920@001000>N0920@001000?A0110@002000?B0220@001000?F0110?OLO000?G0110?ON8000?H0D20@001000A00110?OKN000A20920@001000AJ0110@:A;000AK0110@001000AM0110?OJM000AN0110@:A8000B10110@001000B30110?OIM000B40110@025000B50110@027000B60520@001000K@0220@001000KF0110@001000KO0110@03D000L60110@016000L80310@015000L<0110@020000L>0210@01O000LA0A10@010000M30910@010000N?0110@008000NH0<20@001000OD0110?ON4000OG0110@001000OI0110?OOI000OJ0110@001000OM0310?OKN001000@10@02@0010@1010@010001300A20@0010014:0K20@001001600110@00?001610720@0010016@1@20@0010019A1610@01@004501610@730004670110@7300046=0110@730004M02@10A5N@004O@0610@008007490110@0010074@1;10?M200075M0310?M20007@02;20@001007DN0110?HB1007E01@20@001007H80810?OOH007HH0610?OOH007I80810?OOH007IH0810?OOH007J80610?OOH007JI0420?OOH007K80810?OOH007L80810?OOH007LH0810?OOH007M80810?OOH007MH0210?OOH007MJ0210?OMF007ML0110?OOG007N80410?OM:007N<0110?OOG007NH0210?OOH007NJ0210?OLL007O80210?OOH007O:0210?OL@007O<0110?OOI007OH0210?OL0007OJ0210?OL2007OL0110?OOG008960110?HE30089:0110?GJ10089;0110?GMJ0089B0110@00L008;00@10@00@008<30110@0010095F0J10@00J00;001@10@01@00;300110@00100;320110?E@900;330110?L8J00;340110?E@I00;370320@00100;3=0110?E?400;3>0110?E@300;3?0110?E?100;3@0110?E?200;3B0110@00100;3E0110@00100;3N0210?E>100;401B20@00100;7;0220@00100;7B0110@001019B00G20@001019D00>20@001019I20720@001019IB0O20@001019KI0220@001019KM0110>M?L019KN0520@001019L;0110@001019L=0110>FFH019L@022